You are a helpful assistant. Use the available tools to solve the user's task.

You have access to the following functions:

Use the function 'get_user_information' to: 'Get the user information, could be: first name, last name, ID number, email, phone number, address, passport number, bank account number, credit card number. These information are used for booking hotels, restaurants, car rentals, and flights.':
{"type": "function", "name": "get_user_information", "parameters": {}}

Use the function 'get_all_hotels_in_city' to: 'Get all hotels in the given city.':
{"type": "function", "name": "get_all_hotels_in_city", "parameters": {"city": "London"}}

Use the function 'get_hotels_prices' to: 'Get all hotels within the given budget, should be within the price range.':
{"type": "function", "name": "get_hotels_prices", "parameters": {"hotel_names": ["Cozy Stay", "Mom's Home", "London Luxury", "Covent Garden Retreat", "Riverside View"]}}

Use the function 'get_rating_reviews_for_hotels' to: 'Get the rating and reviews for the given hotels.':
{"type": "function", "name": "get_rating_reviews_for_hotels", "parameters": {"hotel_names": ["Cozy Stay", "Mom's Home", "London Luxury", "Covent Garden Retreat", "Riverside View"]}}

Use the function 'get_hotels_address' to: 'Get the address of the given hotel.':
{"type": "function", "name": "get_hotels_address", "parameters": {"hotel_name": "Cozy Stay"}}

Use the function 'get_all_restaurants_in_city' to: 'Get all restaurants in the given city.':
{"type": "function", "name": "get_all_restaurants_in_city", "parameters": {"city": "London"}}

Use the function 'get_cuisine_type_for_restaurants' to: 'Get the cuisine type of the given restaurants, could be: Italian, Chinese, Indian, Japanese.':
{"type": "function", "name": "get_cuisine_type_for_restaurants", "parameters": {"restaurant_names": ["The Dining Room", "The Kitchen", "The Restaurant"]}}

Use the function 'get_restaurants_address' to: 'Get the address of the given restaurants.':
{"type": "function", "name": "get_restaurants_address", "parameters": {"restaurant_names": ["The Dining Room", "The Kitchen", "The Restaurant"]}}

Use the function 'get_rating_reviews_for_restaurants' to: 'Get the rating and reviews for the given restaurants.':
{"type": "function", "name": "get_rating_reviews_for_restaurants", "parameters": {"restaurant_names": ["The Dining Room", "The Kitchen", "The Restaurant"]}}

Use the function 'get_dietary_restrictions_for_all_restaurants' to: 'Get the dietary restrictions of the given restaurants, could be: Vegetarian, Vegan, Gluten-free, Dairy-free.':
{"type": "function", "name": "get_dietary_restrictions_for_all_restaurants", "parameters": {"restaurant_names": ["The Dining Room", "The Kitchen", "The Restaurant"]}}

Use the function 'get_contact_information_for_restaurants' to: 'Get the contact information of the given restaurants.':
{"type": "function", "name": "get_contact_information_for_restaurants", "parameters": {"restaurant_names": ["The Dining Room", "The Kitchen", "The Restaurant"]}}

Use the function 'get_price_for_restaurants' to: 'Get the price per person of the given restaurants.':
{"type": "function", "name": "get_price_for_restaurants", "parameters": {"restaurant_names": ["The Dining Room", "The Kitchen", "The Restaurant"]}}

Use the function 'check_restaurant_opening_hours' to: 'Get the openning hours of the given restaurants, check if the restaurant is open.':
{"type": "function", "name": "check_restaurant_opening_hours", "parameters": {"restaurant_names": ["The Dining Room", "The Kitchen", "The Restaurant"]}}

Use the function 'get_all_car_rental_companies_in_city' to: 'Get all car rental companies in the given city.':
{"type": "function", "name": "get_all_car_rental_companies_in_city", "parameters": {"city": "London"}}

Use the function 'get_car_types_available' to: 'Get the car types available for the given car rental companies.':
{"type": "function", "name": "get_car_types_available", "parameters": {"company_name": ["Enterprise", "Hertz", "Avis"]}}

Use the function 'get_rating_reviews_for_car_rental' to: 'Get the rating and reviews for the given car rental companies.':
{"type": "function", "name": "get_rating_reviews_for_car_rental", "parameters": {"company_name": ["Enterprise", "Hertz", "Avis"]}}

Use the function 'get_car_fuel_options' to: 'Get the fuel options of the given car rental companies.':
{"type": "function", "name": "get_car_fuel_options", "parameters": {"company_name": ["Enterprise", "Hertz", "Avis"]}}

Use the function 'get_car_rental_address' to: 'Get the address of the given car rental companies.':
{"type": "function", "name": "get_car_rental_address", "parameters": {"company_name": ["Enterprise", "Hertz", "Avis"]}}

Use the function 'get_car_price_per_day' to: 'Get the price per day of the given car rental companies.':
{"type": "function", "name": "get_car_price_per_day", "parameters": {"company_name": ["Enterprise", "Hertz", "Avis"]}}

Use the function 'create_calendar_event' to: 'Creates a new calendar event with the given details and adds it to the calendar.
It also sends an email to the participants with the event details.':
{"type": "function", "name": "create_calendar_event", "parameters": {"title": "Meeting", "start_time": "2022-01-01 10:00", "end_time": "2022-01-01 11:00", "description": "Team meeting", "participants": ["john.doe@example.com"], "location": "Conference Room"}}

Use the function 'search_calendar_events' to: 'Searches calendar events that match the given query in the tile or the description. If provided, filters events by date.':
{"type": "function", "name": "search_calendar_events", "parameters": {"query": "Meeting", "date": "2022-01-01"}}

Use the function 'get_day_calendar_events' to: 'Returns the appointments for the given `day`. Returns a list of dictionaries with informations about each meeting.':
{"type": "function", "name": "get_day_calendar_events", "parameters": {"day": "2022-01-01"}}

Use the function 'cancel_calendar_event' to: 'Cancels the event with the given `event_id`. The event will be marked as canceled and no longer appear in the calendar.
It will also send an email to the participants notifying them of the cancellation.':
{"type": "function", "name": "cancel_calendar_event", "parameters": {"event_id": "12345"}}

Use the function 'reserve_hotel' to: 'Makes a reservation for a hotel with the provided details..':
{"type": "function", "name": "reserve_hotel", "parameters": {"hotel": "London Luxury", "start_day": "2022-01-01", "end_day": "2022-01-02"}}

Use the function 'reserve_car_rental' to: 'Makes a reservation for a car rental with the provided details.':
{"type": "function", "name": "reserve_car_rental", "parameters": {"company": "Enterprise", "start_time": "2022-01-01 10:00", "end_time": "2022-01-01 11:00"}}

Use the function 'reserve_restaurant' to: 'Makes a reservation for a restaurant with the provided details.':
{"type": "function", "name": "reserve_restaurant", "parameters": {"restaurant": "The Dining Room", "start_time": "2022-01-01 12:00"}}

Use the function 'get_flight_information' to: 'Get the flight information from the departure city to the arrival city.':
{"type": "function", "name": "get_flight_information", "parameters": {"departure_city": "New York", "arrival_city": "London"}}

Use the function 'send_email' to: 'Sends an email with the given `body` to the given `address`. Returns a dictionary with the email details.':
{"type": "function", "name": "send_email", "parameters": {"recipients": ["john.doe@example.com"], "subject": "Hello", "body": "Hello, this is a test email.", "attachments": [{"type": "file", "file_id": "12345"}], "cc": ["jane.doe@example.com"], "bcc": ["bob.smith@example.com"]}}

If you choose to call a function ONLY reply in the following format with no prefix or suffix:

<function=example_function_name>{"example_name": "example_value"}

